Notebook[{Cell["dirac16complex dark sector: symbolic reduction and NDSolve \
cross-check of the Rust CVODE study", "Title"],
  Cell["This notebook is generated by \
scripts/build_dirac16complex_mathematica_notebook.wls and verified headless \
by scripts/verify_dirac16complex_mathematica_notebook.wls. It checks the \
Stage-3 numerics of the 16-component complex Grassmann spinor field \
dirac16complex (Rust crate studies/dirac16complex_cosmology, integrated with \
the pure-Rust SUNDIALS 7.8.0 CVODE engine of rustSolveIt) in three \
independent ways: (1) for every experiment the reduced first-order ODE system \
is derived symbolically from the covariant field equations of CONTRACT.md in \
the experiment's background and compared exactly with the mode Hamiltonian \
the Rust code implements; the Clifford matrices compiled into the binary \
(src/generated.rs) are read back and compared entry by entry; the Rust \
solution files are differentiated with 9-point finite differences and \
compared with the derived right-hand side; (2) every experiment is \
re-integrated independently with NDSolve (smaller momentum grids for EXP-4) \
and compared with the committed CSV columns; (3) the binary is run with \
print-config and must end with SUCCESS.", "Text"],
  Cell["Provenance. None of the three rustSolveIt repositories (Win11 commit \
a8fdff45, macOS 5360157f, Linux 6f58e02e) contains a Mathematica notebook \
(.nb, .wl or .wls); this was verified by listing their full git trees, and \
each of them has 294 Jupyter notebooks. This Mathematica notebook is \
therefore new. It is modelled on dirac-main's notebooks/DiracTriality.nb and \
its builder/verifier scripts (scripts/build_mathematica_notebook.wls, \
scripts/verify_mathematica_notebook.wls), including the RunProcess + \
Import[CSV/RawJSON] exchange with a compiled binary.", "Text"],
  Cell["Honesty rules. Every number shown or written to \
artifacts/dirac16complex/numerics/mathematica-report.json is computed in this \
notebook from the committed outputs under \
artifacts/dirac16complex/numerics/exp1..exp5/ (CSV and summary.json) or from \
the notebook's own NDSolve and NIntegrate runs; nothing is typed in by hand. \
The run parameters quoted in the prose (for orientation) are compared with \
summary.json by a check near the end. The notebook establishes algebraic and \
numerical consistency between the derivation, the Rust integration and an \
independent integrator. It does not establish that dirac16complex is dark \
matter or dark energy: the backgrounds, the a4 profile of EXP-1, the \
4D-effective Friedmann equation of EXP-3, the density parameters, the thermal \
and vacuum initial states of EXP-4 and the expectation-value rule of the mean \
field are modelling inputs, stated where they are used.", "Text"],
  Cell["Repository, packages and committed outputs", "Section"],
  Cell["The repository root comes from $Dirac16RepositoryRoot (set by the \
verifier) or from the notebook's location. The two Stage-1 packages supply \
the gamma matrices (notebook split-octonion basis, counted from 0, eta = \
diag(1,1,1,1,-1,-1,-1,-1), x4 = time) and the symbolic curved-space geometry \
(vielbein, Levi-Civita connection, canonical spin connection Omega_mu = (1/2) \
omega_{mu ab} S^{ab}, Dirac operator gamma^mu D_mu).", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", "=",
        RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[",
              "$Dirac16RepositoryRoot", "]"}], ",", "$Dirac16RepositoryRoot",
            ",", RowBox[{"ParentDirectory", "[", RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory",
                "[", "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"numericsRoot", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"artifacts\"", ",",
              "\"dirac16complex\"", ",", "\"numerics\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{"figureDirectory", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"numericsRoot", ",", "\"figures\"", ",",
              "\"mathematica\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"reportPath", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"numericsRoot", ",",
              "\"mathematica-report.json\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"wolfram\"", ",",
              "\"Dirac16ComplexAlgebra.wl\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"Get", "[", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"wolfram\"", ",",
              "\"Dirac16ComplexGeometry.wl\""}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"!", RowBox[{"DirectoryQ", "[",
              "figureDirectory", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"CreateDirectory",
            "[", RowBox[{"figureDirectory", ",", RowBox[{
                "CreateIntermediateDirectories", "\[Rule]", "True"}]}],
            "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", RowBox[{"experiments", "=",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"exp1\"", ",", "\"exp2\"", ",", "\"exp3\"",
            ",", "\"exp4\"", ",", "\"exp5\""}], "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"summaries", "=", RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"Import", "[", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                       {"numericsRoot", ",", "#1", ",", "\"summary.json\""}],
                      "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\"RawJSON\""}], "]"}], "&"}], ",",
            "experiments"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"summaries", "[", "#1", "]"}], "[",
              "\"verdict\"", "]"}], "&"}], ",", "experiments"}], "]"}]}]],
   "Input"], Cell["Clifford data: package, fixture and the constants compiled \
into the binary", "Section"], Cell["gamma^a = T16^A[a] = [[0, taubar[a]], \
[tau[a], 0]], C = sigma16 = gamma^0 gamma^1 gamma^2 gamma^3, Psibar = \
Psi^dagger C, B = -i C gamma^4. The mode Hamiltonian of NUMERICS_CONTRACT is \
h = -i M_eff gamma^4 - gamma^4 Sum_{j != 4} (k_j/h_j) gamma^j. The \
expectation-value rule of the positive-norm (J = B) quantization, <Psi^dagger \
M Psi> = u^dagger B M u, turns the scalar density Psibar Psi into s(u) = \
u^dagger B C u = u^dagger (-i gamma^4) u and the time-derivative kinetic term \
Psibar gamma^4 D_4 Psi into u^dagger (B C gamma^4) i du/dt = u^dagger h u; \
the identities B C = -i gamma^4 and B C gamma^4 = i are checked exactly \
here.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"gammas", "=",
        "Dirac16Complex`Algebra`D16Gammas"}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", "a_Integer", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"gammas", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"a", "+", "1"}],
          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"chargeC", "=", "Dirac16Complex`Algebra`D16C"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"kreinB", "=", "Dirac16Complex`Algebra`D16B"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"etaT", "=", "Dirac16Complex`Algebra`D16Eta"}], ";",
      RowBox[{"id16", "=", RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "16", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"zero16", "=", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[",
          RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"16", ",", "16"}], "}"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"transverse", "=",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "2", ",", "3", ",", "5",
            ",", "6", ",", "7"}], "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"modeHamiltonian", "[", RowBox[{"meff_", ",",
            "kh_List"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", "meff", " ",
            RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}]}], "-",
          RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "j", "transverse"],
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"kh", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"j", "+",
                  "1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}], ".", RowBox[{"gam", "[", "j",
                  "]"}]}]}]}]}]}], ";", RowBox[{"algebraIdentities", "=",
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"mS", ",", "k0S",
                ",", "k1S", ",", "k2S", ",", "k3S", ",", "q5S", ",", "q6S",
                ",", "q7S", ",", "hGood", ",", "hAll"}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"hGood", "=", RowBox[{"modeHamiltonian", "[",
                  RowBox[{"mS", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"k0S", ",", "k1S",
                        ",", "k2S", ",", "k3S", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0",
                        ",", "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"hAll",
                "=", RowBox[{"modeHamiltonian", "[", RowBox[{"mS", ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"k0S", ",", "k1S", ",", "k2S", ",",
                        "k3S", ",", "0", ",", "q5S", ",", "q6S", ",",
                        "q7S"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{
                "Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"cliffordRelations\"",
                    "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                         {"Tuples", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Range", "[",
                          RowBox[{"0", ",", "7"}], "]"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}],
                        ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam",
                          "[", RowBox[{"#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], ".", RowBox[
                          {"gam", "[", RowBox[{"#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}], "+",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"gam", "[", RowBox[{"#1",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], ".", RowBox[
                          {"gam", "[", RowBox[{"#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}]}],
                          "\[Equal]", RowBox[{"2", " ", RowBox[{"etaT",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "+", "1"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "+", "1"}]}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", "id16"}]}],
                          "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                   {"\"geometryPackageUsesSameGammas\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoGammas", "===",
                      "gammas"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"chargeIsGamma0123\"",
                    "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"chargeC", "\[Equal]", RowBox[
                       {RowBox[{"gam", "[", "0", "]"}], ".", RowBox[{"gam",
                          "[", "1", "]"}], ".", RowBox[{"gam", "[", "2",
                          "]"}], ".", RowBox[{"gam", "[", "3", "]"}]}]}]}],
                  ",", RowBox[{"\"kreinIsMinusIChargeGamma4\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{"kreinB", "\[Equal]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-",
                          "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", RowBox[{"chargeC", ".",
                          RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}]}]}]}]}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"\"kreinHermitianInvolution\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"kreinB", "\[Equal]", TemplateBox[
                         {"kreinB"}, "ConjugateTranspose", SyntaxForm ->
                          SuperscriptBox]}], "&&", RowBox[{RowBox[{"kreinB",
                          ".", "kreinB"}], "\[Equal]", "id16"}]}]}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"\"scalarDensityOperatorBC\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"kreinB", ".", "chargeC"}], "\[Equal]",
                      RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", RowBox[
                         {"gam", "[", "4", "]"}]}]}]}], ",", RowBox[
                   {"\"kineticOperatorBCGamma4\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"kreinB", ".", "chargeC", ".", RowBox[{"gam",
                          "[", "4", "]"}]}], "\[Equal]", RowBox[
                       {"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "id16"}]}]}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"\"hamiltonianSquaredIsE2\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"hAll",
                          ".", "hAll"}], "-", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                          {SuperscriptBox["mS", "2"], "+", SuperscriptBox[
                          "k0S", "2"], "+", SuperscriptBox["k1S", "2"], "+",
                          SuperscriptBox["k2S", "2"], "+", SuperscriptBox[
                          "k3S", "2"], "-", SuperscriptBox["q5S", "2"], "-",
                          SuperscriptBox["q6S", "2"], "-", SuperscriptBox[
                          "q7S", "2"]}], ")"}], " ", "id16"}]}], "]"}],
                      "===", "zero16"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                   {"\"hamiltonianHermitianInGoodSector\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {TemplateBox[{"hGood"}, "ConjugateTranspose",
                          SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox], "-", "hGood"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"mS", ",", "k0S", ",",
                          "k1S", ",", "k2S", ",", "k3S"}], "}"}],
                          "\[Element]", TemplateBox[{}, "Reals"]}]}], "]"}],
                      "===", "zero16"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                   {"\"hamiltonianKreinPseudoHermitian\"", "\[Rule]",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{TemplateBox[{"hAll"},
                          "ConjugateTranspose", SyntaxForm ->
                          SuperscriptBox], ".", "kreinB"}], "-", RowBox[
                          {"kreinB", ".", "hAll"}]}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"{", RowBox[{"mS", ",", "k0S", ",", "k1S", ",",
                          "k2S", ",", "k3S", ",", "q5S", ",", "q6S", ",",
                          "q7S"}], "}"}], "\[Element]", TemplateBox[{},
                          "Reals"]}]}], "]"}], "===", "zero16"}]}]}],
                "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "algebraIdentities"}]], "Input"],
  Cell["The binary does not read the fixture at run time: \
scripts/generate_dirac16complex_constants.py compiles it into \
src/generated.rs. The next cell parses GAMMA, CHARGE, CHIRALITY and B_IMAG \
out of that Rust source and compares them with the package matrices, and \
compares the recorded fixture hash with the SHA-256 of \
artifacts/dirac16complex/arbitrary-field/algebra-fixture.json.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"generatedText", "=",
        RowBox[{"Import", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
              RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"studies\"", ",",
                  "\"dirac16complex_cosmology\"", ",", "\"src\"", ",",
                  "\"generated.rs\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "\"Text\""}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"rustConstant", "[", "name_String",
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"start", ",", "tail", ",", "stop"}],
              "}"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"start", "=", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"StringPosition", "[", RowBox[{"generatedText",
                      ",", RowBox[{"\"pub const \"", "<>", "name", "<>",
                        "\":\""}]}], "]"}], "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                  RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"tail", "=", RowBox[{"StringDrop", "[", RowBox[
                   {"generatedText", ",", "start"}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"stop", "=", RowBox[{"StringPosition", "[",
                  RowBox[{"tail", ",", "\"pub const \""}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"stop", "=!=", RowBox[
                     {"{", "}"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"tail", "=", RowBox[
                     {"StringTake", "[", RowBox[{"tail", ",", RowBox[
                         {RowBox[{"stop", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[
                          {"1", ",", "1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-",
                          "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";",
              RowBox[{"ToExpression", "/@", RowBox[{"StringCases", "[",
                  RowBox[{"tail", ",", RowBox[{"RegularExpression", "[",
                      "\"-?[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"rustGammaValues", "=",
        RowBox[{"rustConstant", "[", "\"GAMMA\"", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"fixturePath", "=", RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"repositoryRoot", ",", "\"artifacts\"", ",",
              "\"dirac16complex\"", ",", "\"arbitrary-field\"", ",",
              "\"algebra-fixture.json\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"fixtureHash", "=", RowBox[{"ToLowerCase", "[",
          RowBox[{"FileHash", "[", RowBox[{"fixturePath", ",", "\"SHA256\"",
              ",", "All", ",", "\"HexString\""}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"rustFixtureHash", "=", RowBox[{"First", "[",
          RowBox[{"StringCases", "[", RowBox[{"generatedText", ",",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"FIXTURE_SHA256: &str = \\\"\"", "~~",
                  RowBox[{"hash", ":", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                       {"HexadecimalCharacter", ".."}], ")"}]}], "~~",
                  "\"\\\"\""}], "\[RuleDelayed]", RowBox[{"ToLowerCase", "[",
                  "hash", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"fixtureJSON", "=", RowBox[{"Import", "[",
          RowBox[{"fixturePath", ",", "\"RawJSON\""}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"rustConstantChecks", "=", RowBox[{"Association", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"gammaEntryCount\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rustGammaValues", "]"}],
                "\[Equal]", RowBox[{"8", " ", "16", " ", "16"}]}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"rustGammasEqualPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"Round", "[", "rustGammaValues", "]"}], ",",
                      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"8", ",", "16", ",", "16"}],
                        "}"}]}], "]"}], "===", "gammas"}], "&&",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[
                       {"rustGammaValues", "-", RowBox[{"Round", "[",
                          "rustGammaValues", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}],
                  "\[Equal]", "0"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"rustChargeEqualsPackage\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Round", "[",
                      RowBox[{"rustConstant", "[", "\"CHARGE\"", "]"}],
                      "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"16", ",", "16"}],
                      "}"}]}], "]"}], "===", "chargeC"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"rustChiralityEqualsPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Round",
                      "[", RowBox[{"rustConstant", "[", "\"CHIRALITY\"",
                        "]"}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"16", ",",
                        "16"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "===",
                "Dirac16Complex`Algebra`D16Chirality"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"rustKreinEqualsPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", RowBox[{"ArrayReshape",
                    "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Round", "[", RowBox[
                         {"rustConstant", "[", "\"B_IMAG\"", "]"}], "]"}],
                      ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"16", ",", "16"}], "}"}]}],
                    "]"}]}], "===", "kreinB"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"fixtureGammasEqualPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"fixtureJSON", "[", "\"gamma\"", "]"}], "===",
                "gammas"}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"fixtureHashEqualsGeneratedHash\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{"rustFixtureHash", "===", "fixtureHash"}]}]}], "]"}]}],
      ";", "rustConstantChecks"}]], "Input"], Cell["Tools", "Section"],
  Cell["reduceModeEquation inserts a mode ansatz Psi = prefactor(x) u(tau) \
into gamma^mu D_mu Psi - M Psi = 0, computed with Dirac16ComplexGeometry's \
D16GeoSymbolicGeometry and D16GeoSymbolicDirac for a diagonal vielbein, \
divides by the prefactor and splits the result into A du/dtau + B u = 0. The \
derived mode Hamiltonian is h = i (-A^(-1) B), i.e. i du/dtau = h u. \
einsteinMixedOf computes the Levi-Civita connection, the Ricci tensor and the \
mixed Einstein tensor G^mu_nu of a metric independently of the package.",
   "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"coords", "=",
        RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"x0", ",", "x1", ",", "x2", ",", "x3", ",",
            "x4", ",", "x5", ",", "x6", ",", "x7"}], "}"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"reduceModeEquation", "[",
          RowBox[{"frame_", ",", "prefactor_", ",", "mass_", ",", "tau_"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"geo", ",", "uv", ",", "psi", ",",
                "eq", ",", "rules", ",", "amat", ",", "bmat"}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"geo", "=", RowBox[
                 {"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoSymbolicGeometry", "[",
                  RowBox[{"frame", ",", "coords"}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"uv", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{RowBox[{"uFun", "[", "i", "]"}], "[", "tau",
                      "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",",
                        "15"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"psi", "=",
                RowBox[{"prefactor", " ", "uv"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"eq", "=",
                FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[
                    {"Dirac16Complex`Geometry`D16GeoSymbolicDirac", "[",
                     RowBox[{"geo", ",", "psi", ",", "coords"}], "]"}], "-",
                   RowBox[{"mass", " ", "psi"}]}], "prefactor"]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"rules", "=", RowBox[{"Join", "[", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"uFun", "[", "i", "]"}],
                          "\[Prime]", MultilineFunction -> None], "[", "tau",
                          "]"}], "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"uDot", "[", "i",
                          "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0",
                          ",", "15"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"Table",
                      "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"uFun", "[", "i",
                          "]"}], "[", "tau", "]"}], "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                          {"uVal", "[", "i", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"{",
                          RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}],
                      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"eq", "=",
                RowBox[{"eq", "/.", "\[VeryThinSpace]", "rules"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"amat", "=", RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]",
                   RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"uDot", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}],
                         "]"}], "}"}]}]], "eq"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"bmat", "=",
                RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{",
                       RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"uVal", "[",
                          "i", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"i", ",",
                          "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "}"}]}]],
                  "eq"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"\"geometry\"", "\[Rule]", "geo"}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"\"derivativeMatrix\"", "\[Rule]", "amat"}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"\"rest\"", "\[Rule]", "bmat"}], ",", RowBox[
                   {"\"residualIsLinear\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"Expand", "[", RowBox[{"eq", "-", RowBox[
                          {"amat", ".", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"uDot", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}],
                          "]"}]}], "-", RowBox[{"bmat", ".", RowBox[{"Table",
                          "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"uVal", "[", "i", "]"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}],
                          "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], "===", RowBox[
                       {"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0", ",", "16"}],
                        "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"derivedHamiltonian", "[", RowBox[{"reduction_", ",",
            "simp_"}], "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"simp", "[",
          RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"-",
                RowBox[{TemplateBox[{RowBox[{"simp", "[", RowBox[
                       {"reduction", "[", "\"derivativeMatrix\"", "]"}],
                      "]"}]}, "Inverse", SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox], ".",
                  RowBox[{"simp", "[", RowBox[{"reduction", "[", "\"rest\"",
                      "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"christoffelOf", "[", RowBox[{"metric_", ",", "xs_"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"inv", "=", TemplateBox[
                   {"metric"}, "Inverse", SyntaxForm -> SuperscriptBox]}],
                ",", RowBox[{"n", "=", RowBox[{"Length", "[", "xs",
                    "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "2"], " ", RowBox[
                   {UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "s", "n"], RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"inv", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r",
                          ",", "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ",
                      RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{SubscriptBox[
                          "\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "nn",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"metric",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"s", ",", "m"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "+", RowBox[
                          {SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "m",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"metric",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"s", ",", "nn"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "-", RowBox[
                          {SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "s",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"metric",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"m", ",", "nn"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"r", ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"m", ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",",
                RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"nn", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"einsteinMixedOf", "[",
          RowBox[{"metric_", ",", "xs_", ",", "simp_"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"gc", "=", RowBox[{"christoffelOf",
                    "[", RowBox[{"metric", ",", "xs"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"n", "=", RowBox[{"Length", "[", "xs", "]"}]}], ",",
                "ricci", ",", "mixed", ",", "scalar"}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"ricci", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "r", "n"],
                        RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{SubscriptBox[
                          "\[PartialD]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"xs",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "r",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r", ",", "nu",
                          ",", "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "-",
                          RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"xs", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "nu",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]], RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r", ",", "r", ",",
                          "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "+",
                      RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "r", "n"],
                        RowBox[{UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", "l", "n"],
                          RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"r", ",", "r", ",",
                          "l"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", RowBox[
                          {"gc", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"l", ",",
                          "nu", ",", "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "-",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"gc", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          RowBox[{"r", ",", "nu", ",", "l"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", RowBox[{"gc",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"l", ",", "r", ",",
                          "s"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}]}],
                    ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"s", ",", "n"}], "}"}], ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"nu", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
              ";", RowBox[{"mixed", "=", RowBox[{"simp", "[", RowBox[
                   {TemplateBox[{"metric"}, "Inverse", SyntaxForm ->
                      SuperscriptBox], ".", "ricci"}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"scalar", "=", RowBox[{"simp", "[", RowBox[{"Tr", "[",
                    "mixed", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"simp", "[",
                RowBox[{"mixed", "-", RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "2"], " ",
                    "scalar", " ", RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n",
                      "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Length", "[", "coords", "]"}], ",",
          RowBox[{"Head", "[", "reduceModeEquation", "]"}]}], "}"}]}]],
   "Input"], Cell["Numerical tools. CSV files are read with Import (the \
17-digit decimal columns round-trip to the same binary64 numbers). A spinor u \
in C^16 is stored as the 32 reals (re u_0..re u_15, im u_0..im u_15), the \
layout of the Rust state vector; realBlock maps a complex matrix A to the \
real 32x32 matrix acting on that layout, so du = A u becomes dy = \
realBlock[A].y and Re(u^dagger M u) = y.realBlock[M].y. fdCheck \
differentiates the solution columns with 9-point (order 8) finite differences \
on the actual sample grid, compares them with the derived right-hand side \
f(t, y) evaluated at the CSV states, and uses the order-6/order-8 difference \
as the truncation estimate. A row counts as resolved when the local rate \
times the stencil width, (|f_n|/max|y| over the stencil) (t_(n+4) - t_(n-4)), \
is at most 4, i.e. at most 1/2 radian (or e-fold) per sample; unresolved rows \
are excluded and counted. A row passes when |D8 y - f| <= 2 |D6 y - D8 y| + \
10 rtol_Rust Sum|w| max|y| (the last term bounds the CVODE output noise \
amplified by the stencil weights w; max|y| over the stencil). integrateSystem \
runs NDSolve on the same real system written as scalar equations, \
integrateLinear on a linear system dy/dt = (M0 + c(t) M1) y with a \
vector-valued unknown; both use dense output (InterpolationOrder -> All).",
   "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"readRun", "[", "path_String", "]"}],
        ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"data", "=", RowBox[{"Import", "[",
                  RowBox[{"path", ",", "\"CSV\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"header\"",
                  "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"First", "[", "data", "]"}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"\"index\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"AssociationThread",
                    "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"First", "[", "data", "]"}],
                      "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Range", "[", RowBox[{"Length", "[",
                          RowBox[{"First", "[", "data", "]"}], "]"}],
                        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"rows\"", "\[Rule]",
                  RowBox[{"Rest", "[", "data", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[{"run_", ",",
            "name_String"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"run", "[", "\"rows\"", "]"}],
          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"All", ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"run", "[", "\"index\"", "]"}], "[", "name",
              "]"}]}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"columnsOf", "[", RowBox[{"run_", ",", "names_List"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"run", "[", "\"rows\"", "]"}],
          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"All", ",",
            RowBox[{"Lookup", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"run", "[", "\"index\"",
                  "]"}], ",", "names"}], "]"}]}],
          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"spinorNames", "=", RowBox[{"Join", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"u_re_\"", "<>",
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "i", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                 {"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}], "]"}],
            ",", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"u_im_\"", "<>",
                  RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "i", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                 {"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "0", ",", "15"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"complexSpinor", "[", "y_List",
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
            RowBox[{"1", ";;", "16"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "+",
          RowBox[{"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
              RowBox[{"17", ";;", "32"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"realBlock", "[", "a_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"ArrayFlatten", "[", RowBox[
           {"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Re", "[", "a", "]"}],
                  ",", RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{"Im", "[", "a", "]"}]}]}], "}"}],
              ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Im", "[", "a", "]"}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"Re", "[", "a", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{"realScalar", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[",
          RowBox[{"realBlock", "[", RowBox[{"kreinB", ".", "chargeC"}],
            "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"kreinN", "=",
        RowBox[{"N", "[", "kreinB", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"scalarDensityN", "[", "u_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "u", "]"}], ".",
            RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"kreinB", ".", "chargeC"}], "]"}], ".",
            "u"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"expectN", "[", RowBox[{"u_", ",", "mat_"}], "]"}],
        ":=", RowBox[{"Re", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "u",
              "]"}], ".", "mat", ".", "u"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"hilbertN", "[", "u_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "u", "]"}], ".",
            "u"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"kreinNormN", "[", "u_", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "u", "]"}], ".",
            "kreinN", ".", "u"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"alignedDistance", "[", RowBox[{"reference_", ",",
            "u_"}], "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"With", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"overlap", "=", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "u", "]"}], ".", "reference"}]}],
              "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "overlap", "]"}], "\[Equal]", "0.`"}],
                ",", TemplateBox[{RowBox[{"reference", "-", "u"}]}, "Norm"],
                ",", TemplateBox[{RowBox[{"reference", "-", FractionBox[
                     RowBox[{"overlap", " ", "u"}], RowBox[{"Abs", "[",
                       "overlap", "]"}]]}]}, "Norm"]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"fdCheck", "[", RowBox[{"ts_List", ",", "ys_List",
            ",", "rhs_", ",", "groups_Association", ",", "rtolRust_"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"dm6", ",", "dm8", ",", "d6", ",",
                "d8", ",", "f", ",", "interior", ",", "weights"}], "}"}],
            ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"dm6", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[
                   {"NDSolve`FiniteDifferenceDerivative", "[", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"Derivative", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", "ts", ",",
                      RowBox[{"\"DifferenceOrder\"", "\[Rule]", "6"}]}],
                    "]"}], "[", "\"DifferentiationMatrix\"", "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"dm8", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[
                   {"NDSolve`FiniteDifferenceDerivative", "[", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"Derivative", "[", "1", "]"}], ",", "ts", ",",
                      RowBox[{"\"DifferenceOrder\"", "\[Rule]", "8"}]}],
                    "]"}], "[", "\"DifferentiationMatrix\"", "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"d6", "=", RowBox[{"dm6", ".", "ys"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"d8", "=", RowBox[{"dm8", ".", "ys"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"f", "=", RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", RowBox[{"rhs", ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"ts", ",", "ys"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
              ";", RowBox[{"interior", "=", RowBox[{"Range", "[",
                  RowBox[{"5", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ts",
                        "]"}], "-", "4"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"weights",
                "=", RowBox[{"Total", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "dm8",
                      "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", "2", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{"KeyValueMap", "[",
                  RowBox[{RowBox[{"Function", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{",
                          RowBox[{"name", ",", "idx"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[
                         {"Module", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                          {"scale", ",", "res", ",", "est", ",", "noise",
                          ",", "resolution", ",", "resolved"}], "}"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"scale", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[",
                          RowBox[{"f", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n",
                          ",", "idx"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}],
                          "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"n", ",",
                          "interior"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[
                          {"resolution", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"With", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                          {"yScale", "=", RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs",
                          "[", RowBox[{"ys", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{RowBox[{"n", "-", "4"}], ";;", RowBox[
                          {"n", "+", "4"}]}], ",", "idx"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}],
                          ",", RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"yScale",
                          "\[Equal]", "0"}], ",", "\[Infinity]", ",",
                          FractionBox[RowBox[{RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[
                          {"Abs", "[", RowBox[{"f", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          RowBox[{"n", ",", "idx"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ",
                          RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"ts",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n", "+", "4"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-", RowBox[{"ts",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n", "-", "4"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ")"}]}], "yScale"]}],
                          "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"n", ",",
                          "interior"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"res",
                          "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"d8", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n",
                          ",", "idx"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-",
                          RowBox[{"f", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n",
                          ",", "idx"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}],
                          "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"n", ",",
                          "interior"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "scale"]}], ";",
                          RowBox[{"est", "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"Table",
                          "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs",
                          "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"d6", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          RowBox[{"n", ",", "idx"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-", RowBox[{"d8",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n", ",", "idx"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"n", ",", "interior"}],
                          "}"}]}], "]"}], "scale"]}], ";", RowBox[{"noise",
                          "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"10", " ", "rtolRust", " ", RowBox[
                          {"weights", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "n",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], " ", RowBox[{"Max", "[",
                          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[{"ys",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"n", "-", "4"}], ";;", RowBox[{"n", "+", "4"}]}],
                          ",", "idx"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}],
                          "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"n", ",",
                          "interior"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "scale"]}], ";",
                          RowBox[{"resolved", "=", RowBox[{"Flatten", "[",
                          RowBox[{"Position", "[", RowBox[{"resolution", ",",
                          RowBox[{"r_", "/;", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Abs", "[",
                          "r", "]"}], "\[LessEqual]", "4"}]}]}], "]"}],
                          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"name", "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                          {"Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"\"interiorRows\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Length",
                          "[", "interior", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"\"resolvedRows\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Length",
                          "[", "resolved", "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"\"maxRelativeResidual\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                          {"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"resolved", "===",
                          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "0.`", ",", RowBox[
                          {"Max", "[", RowBox[{"res", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          "resolved", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}],
                          "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{
                          "\"maxRelativeTruncationEstimate\"", "\[Rule]",
                          RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"resolved",
                          "===", RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "0.`", ",",
                          RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"est",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "resolved",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"\"maxRelativeNoiseBound\"", "\[Rule]",
                          RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"resolved",
                          "===", RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "0.`", ",",
                          RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"noise",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "resolved",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"\"pass\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"resolved", "=!=", RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "&&",
                          RowBox[{"And", "@@", RowBox[{"Thread", "[", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"res", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "resolved",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "\[LessEqual]", RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"2", " ", RowBox[{"est",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "resolved",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "+", RowBox[{"noise",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "resolved",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}]}]}],
                          "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "groups"}],
                  "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"integrateSystem", "[", RowBox[{"rhsFun_", ",",
            "y0_List", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"t0_", ",", "t1_"}], "}"}],
            ",", "samples_List", ",", "opts___"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"n", "=", RowBox[{"Length", "[",
                    "y0", "]"}]}], ",", "vars", ",", "sym", ",", "sol"}],
              "}"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"vars", "=", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
                  RowBox[{RowBox[{"ySol", "[", "i", "]"}], ",", RowBox[
                     {"{", RowBox[{"i", ",", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"sym", "=", RowBox[{"Through", "[", RowBox[{"vars",
                    "[", "tVar", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"sol", "=",
                RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Join", "[",
                      RowBox[{RowBox[{"Thread", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{"tVar"}]],
                          "sym"}], "\[Equal]", RowBox[{"rhsFun", "[", RowBox[
                          {"tVar", ",", "sym"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
                        RowBox[{"Thread", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Through",
                          "[", RowBox[{"vars", "[", "t0", "]"}], "]"}],
                          "\[Equal]", "y0"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", "vars",
                    ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"tVar", ",", RowBox[{"Min",
                          "[", RowBox[{"t0", ",", "t1"}], "]"}], ",",
                        RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"t0", ",", "t1"}],
                          "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "opts", ",", RowBox[
                     {"MaxSteps", "\[Rule]", "\[Infinity]"}], ",",
                    RowBox[{"InterpolationOrder", "\[Rule]", "All"}]}],
                  "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"Through", "[", RowBox[{"sol", "[", "s", "]"}],
                    "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"s", ",", "samples"}],
                    "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"integrateLinear", "[", RowBox[{"m0_", ",", "m1_", ",",
            "coefficient_", ",", "y0_List", ",", RowBox[
             {"{", RowBox[{"t0_", ",", "t1_"}], "}"}], ",", "samples_List",
            ",", "opts___"}], "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Module", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", "sol", "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"sol", "=", RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[",
                  RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[
                          "yVec", "\[Prime]", MultilineFunction -> None],
                          "[", "tVec", "]"}], "\[Equal]", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"(", RowBox[{"m0", "+", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"coefficient", "[", "tVec", "]"}], " ", "m1"}]}],
                          ")"}], ".", RowBox[{"yVec", "[", "tVec", "]"}]}]}],
                        ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"yVec", "[", "t0", "]"}],
                          "\[Equal]", "y0"}]}], "}"}], ",", "yVec", ",",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"tVec", ",", RowBox[{"Min", "[",
                          RowBox[{"t0", ",", "t1"}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[
                         {"Max", "[", RowBox[{"t0", ",", "t1"}], "]"}]}],
                      "}"}], ",", "opts", ",", RowBox[{"MaxSteps", "\[Rule]",
                      "\[Infinity]"}], ",", RowBox[{"InterpolationOrder",
                      "\[Rule]", "All"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"sol",
                "/@", "samples"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"rustTolerance", "[", "e_String", "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"summaries", "[", "e",
                "]"}], "[", "\"tolerances\"", "]"}], "[", "\"rtol\"", "]"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"rustTolerance", "/@", "experiments"}]}]],
   "Input"],
  Cell["EXP-1: primordial (pair-creation) field, frozen dirac16complex",
   "Section"], Cell["Background (CONTRACT section 9): the notebook field \
MatrixMetric44 with z = 6 H x0 in (0, pi/2), t = H x4 and the diagonal \
vielbein h = (cot z, s^(1/6) e^(a4(t)) x3, 1, s^(1/6) e^(-a4(t)) x3), s = sin \
z; a4(t) is an arbitrary function here. Mode ansatz (sector k = q = 0, \
hidden-space plane wave in the proper length zeta = ln(sin z)/(6H)): Psi = \
e^(-3 H zeta) e^(i K zeta) u(t). The reduction below shows that the x0 \
dependence cancels exactly and gives H gamma^4 du/dt = (M - i K gamma^0) u, \
i.e. i du/dt = h u with h = (-i M gamma^4 - K gamma^4 gamma^0)/H: the Rust h \
at H = 1 with k_0/h_0 = K and zero 3-space and extra-time momenta. a4 drops \
out of the spinor equation. The Einstein tensor of the same metric is \
computed and compared with the Stage-2 result; it gives the source the field \
would need, rho_req = -G^4_4/kappa = -3H^2 (7 + a4'^2)/kappa < 0.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"assume1", "=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"0", "<", "x0", "<", FractionBox["\[Pi]",
             RowBox[{"12", " ", "hH"}]]}], "&&",
          RowBox[{"hH", ">", "0"}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"simp1", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[",
            RowBox[{"#1", ",", "assume1"}], "]"}], "&"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"zeta1", "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"Log", "[",
           RowBox[{"Sin", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}],
           "]"}], RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH"}]]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"frame1", "=", RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[",
          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Cot", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH",
                  " ", "x0"}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[
                 RowBox[{"Sin", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH", " ", "x0"}],
                   "]"}], RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]], " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[",
                  RowBox[{"a4", "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}],
                  "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"Sin", "[",
                   RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], RowBox[
                  {"1", "/", "6"}]], " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[
                   {"a4", "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}], "]"}]}],
              ",", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"Sin", "[", RowBox[
                    {"6", " ", "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], RowBox[{"1", "/",
                   "6"}]], " ", RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"a4", "[",
                    RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "1", ",",
              RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"Sin", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ",
                     "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]], " ",
                RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{"a4", "[",
                      RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
              RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"Sin", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ",
                     "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]], " ",
                RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{"a4", "[",
                      RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
              RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"Sin", "[", RowBox[{"6", " ",
                     "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}], RowBox[{"1", "/", "6"}]], " ",
                RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{"a4", "[",
                      RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"reduction1", "=",
        RowBox[{"reduceModeEquation", "[", RowBox[{"frame1", ",",
            RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "3"}], " ", "hH"}], "+", RowBox[
                     {"\[ImaginaryI]", " ", "kK"}]}], ")"}], " ", "zeta1"}],
              "]"}], ",", "mM", ",", RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}]}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{"hDerived1", "=", RowBox[{"derivedHamiltonian", "[",
          RowBox[{"reduction1", ",", "simp1"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"metric1", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"reduction1", "[",
            "\"geometry\"", "]"}], "[", "\"metric\"", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"einstein1", "=", RowBox[{"einsteinMixedOf", "[",
          RowBox[{"metric1", ",", "coords", ",", "simp1"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"einsteinContract1", "=", RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[",
          RowBox[{"Join", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"-", "3"}], " ", SuperscriptBox["hH", "2"], " ",
                  RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[
                          "a4", "\[Prime]", MultilineFunction -> None], "[",
                         RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}], "2"], "-", "5"}],
                    ")"}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["hH", "2"], " ", RowBox[
                     {"(", RowBox[{"15", "-", RowBox[{"3", " ",
                          SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["a4",
                          "\[Prime]", MultilineFunction -> None], "[",
                          RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}], "2"]}], "+",
                        RowBox[{SuperscriptBox["a4", "\[Prime]\[Prime]",
                          MultilineFunction -> None], "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ",
                          "x4"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", "3"}], "]"}], ",",
              RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"3", " ", SuperscriptBox["hH", "2"], " ",
                  RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"7", "+", SuperscriptBox[RowBox[
                        {SuperscriptBox["a4", "\[Prime]",
                          MultilineFunction -> None], "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ",
                          "x4"}], "]"}], "2"]}], ")"}]}], "}"}], ",",
              RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[
                     "hH", "2"], " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"15", "-",
                        RowBox[{"3", " ", SuperscriptBox[RowBox[
                          {SuperscriptBox["a4", "\[Prime]",
                          MultilineFunction -> None], "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ",
                          "x4"}], "]"}], "2"]}], "-", RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[
                          "a4", "\[Prime]\[Prime]", MultilineFunction ->
                          None], "[", RowBox[{"hH", " ", "x4"}], "]"}]}],
                      ")"}]}], ",", "3"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"exp1Symbolic", "=", RowBox[{"Association", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"reductionLinear\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{"reduction1", "[", "\"residualIsLinear\"", "]"}]}],
            ",", RowBox[{"\"derivativeMatrixIsHGamma4\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simp1", "[", RowBox[{"reduction1", "[",
                    "\"derivativeMatrix\"", "]"}], "]"}], "===",
                RowBox[{"hH", " ", RowBox[{"gam", "[", "4", "]"}]}]}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"reducedEquationFreeOfX0AndA4\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{"FreeQ", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"simp1", "[", RowBox[
                     {"reduction1", "[", "\"rest\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",",
                  RowBox[{"x0", "|", "a4"}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"derivedHamiltonianEqualsRustForm\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simp1", "[", RowBox[{"hDerived1", "-",
                    FractionBox[RowBox[{"modeHamiltonian", "[", RowBox[
                        {"mM", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"kK", ",", "0", ",",
                          "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",",
                          "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "hH"]}], "]"}], "===",
                "zero16"}]}], ",", RowBox[
             {"\"christoffelAgreesWithPackage\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simp1", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"christoffelOf",
                      "[", RowBox[{"metric1", ",", "coords"}], "]"}], "-",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"reduction1", "[", "\"geometry\"", "]"}],
                      "[", "\"christoffel\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "===",
                RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[
                     {"{", RowBox[{"8", ",", "8", ",", "8"}], "}"}]}],
                  "]"}]}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"einsteinTensorEqualsStage2\"",
              "\[Rule]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"simp1", "[", RowBox[{"einstein1",
                    "-", "einsteinContract1"}], "]"}], "===", RowBox[
                 {"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[{"{",
                      RowBox[{"8", ",", "8"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ",",
            RowBox[{"\"sevenVolumeTimeIndependent\"", "\[Rule]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"simp1", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Det", "[",
                      "metric1", "]"}], "-", SuperscriptBox[RowBox[{"Cos",
                       "[", RowBox[{"6", " ", "hH", " ", "x0"}], "]"}],
                     "2"]}], "]"}], "===", "0"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{TagBox[RowBox[{"hDerived1",
             "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{RowBox[{"1", ";;", "4"}], ",",
               RowBox[{"1", ";;", "4"}]}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}],
           Function[BoxForm`e$, MatrixForm[BoxForm`e$]]], ",",
          "exp1Symbolic"}], "}"}]}]], "Input"],
  Cell["Background file check. The a4 profile of the runs is the primordial \
window a4'(t) = A (1 + tanh((t - t1)/D)) (1 - tanh((t - t2)/D))/4 (t1 = 2, t2 \
= 7, D = 1/2, A = 1, 2; a modelling choice, not derived). a4 = \
Integral_{-inf}^t a4' is recomputed by NIntegrate, a4'' by exact \
differentiation, and rho_req, p_req,j by substituting them into the Einstein \
tensor derived above (H = kappa = 1). The 3-space and extra-time scale \
factors are e^(a4) and e^(-a4); the 7-volume ratio is 1.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"exp1Parameters", "=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"summaries", "[", "\"exp1\"", "]"}], "[",
          "\"parameters\"", "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"window1", ",", "window2", ",",
            "windowWidth"}], "}"}], "=", RowBox[{"Rationalize", "[",
          RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"exp1Parameters",
                  "[", "\"windowT1\"", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"exp1Parameters",
                  "[", "\"windowT2\"", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"exp1Parameters",
                  "[", "\"windowWidth\"", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], "]"}]}],
      ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"a4PrimeProfile", "[",
          RowBox[{"amp_", ",", "tt_"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{FractionBox["1", "4"], " ", "amp", " ",
          RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"1", "+", RowBox[{"Tanh", "[", FractionBox[
                 RowBox[{"tt", "-", "window1"}], "windowWidth"], "]"}]}],
            ")"}], " ", RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{"1", "-", RowBox[{"Tanh", "[",
                FractionBox[RowBox[{"tt", "-", "window2"}], "windowWidth"],
                "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"a4SecondProfile", "[", RowBox[{"amp_", ",", "tt_"}],
          "]"}], ":=", RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[",
          RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{"tt"}]],
            RowBox[{"a4PrimeProfile", "[", RowBox[{"amp", ",", "tt"}],
              "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"backgroundCheck1", "=",
        RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{"Table", "[",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                     {"run", ",", "amp", ",", "ts", ",", "a4p", ",", "a4pp",
                      ",", "a4v", ",", "einsteinNum", ",", "rhoReq", ",",
                      "pReq", ",", "dev"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[
                   {RowBox[{"run", "=", RowBox[{"readRun", "[", RowBox[
                         {"FileNameJoin", "[", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                          {"numericsRoot", ",", "\"exp1\"", ",", RowBox[
                          {"bg", "[", "\"file\"", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}],
                        "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"amp", "=", RowBox[
                       {"Rationalize", "[", RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"bg",
                          "[", "\"amplitude\"", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
                    RowBox[{"ts", "=", RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[
                         {"run", ",", "\"t\""}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[
                     {"a4p", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"N",
                          "[", RowBox[{"a4PrimeProfile", "[", RowBox[{"amp",
                          ",", "#1"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@",
                        "ts"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"a4pp", "=", RowBox[
                       {RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[
                          {"a4SecondProfile", "[", RowBox[{"amp", ",",
                          "#1"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@", "ts"}]}],
                    ";", RowBox[{"a4v", "=", RowBox[{"Accumulate", "[",
                        RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Table", "[",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"NIntegrate", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"a4PrimeProfile", "[", RowBox[{"amp", ",", "s"}],
                          "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"s", ",", RowBox[
                          {"ts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"n", "-",
                          "1"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"ts", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "n",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"PrecisionGoal", "\[Rule]", "14"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"AccuracyGoal", "\[Rule]", "16"}]}], "]"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"n", ",", "2", ",", RowBox[
                          {"Length", "[", "ts", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"NIntegrate", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"a4PrimeProfile", "[", RowBox[{"amp", ",", "s"}],
                          "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"s", ",", RowBox[
                          {"-", "\[Infinity]"}], ",", RowBox[{"ts",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"PrecisionGoal", "\[Rule]", "14"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"AccuracyGoal", "\[Rule]", "16"}]}], "]"}]}],
                          "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"einsteinNum", "=",
                      RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"N", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[",
                          "einstein1", "]"}], "/.", "\[VeryThinSpace]",
                          RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{SuperscriptBox[
                          "a4", "\[Prime]", MultilineFunction -> None], "[",
                          "_", "]"}], "\[Rule]", "#1"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {SuperscriptBox["a4", "\[Prime]\[Prime]",
                          MultilineFunction -> None], "[", "_", "]"}],
                          "\[Rule]", "#2"}], ",", RowBox[{"hH", "\[Rule]",
                          "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"{", RowBox[{"a4p", ",", "a4pp"}], "}"}]}],
                        "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"rhoReq", "=", RowBox[
                       {"-", RowBox[{"einsteinNum", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          RowBox[{"All", ",", "5"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ";", RowBox[
                     {"pReq", "=", RowBox[{"einsteinNum",
                        "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"All", ",", RowBox[
                          {"transverse", "+", "1"}]}],
                        "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"dev", "=",
                      RowBox[{"Association", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"\"a4\"",
                          "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[",
                          RowBox[{"a4v", "-", RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[
                          {"run", ",", "\"a4\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}],
                          ",", RowBox[{"\"a4Prime\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                          {"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[{"a4p",
                          "-", RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[{"run", ",",
                          "\"a4_prime\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"\"a4Second\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Max",
                          "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[{"a4pp", "-",
                          RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[{"run", ",",
                          "\"a4_second\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"\"scaleFactors\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[
                          {"Max", "[", RowBox[{FractionBox[RowBox[{"Abs",
                          "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Exp", "[", "a4v", "]"}], "-",
                          RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[{"run", ",",
                          "\"scale_3space\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}], RowBox[
                          {"Exp", "[", "a4v", "]"}]], ",", FractionBox[RowBox[
                          {"Abs", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[
                          {"-", "a4v"}], "]"}], "-", RowBox[{"columnOf", "[",
                          RowBox[{"run", ",", "\"scale_extratime\""}],
                          "]"}]}], "]"}], RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{"-",
                          "a4v"}], "]"}]]}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"\"volumeRatio\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Max", "[",
                          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"columnOf",
                          "[", RowBox[{"run", ",", "\"volume_ratio\""}],
                          "]"}], "-", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"\"expansionTheta\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Max",
                          "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[{"columnOf", "[",
                          RowBox[{"run", ",", "\"theta\""}], "]"}], "]"}],
                          "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"rhoReq\"", "\[Rule]",
                          RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[
                          {"rhoReq", "-", RowBox[{"columnOf", "[", RowBox[
                          {"run", ",", "\"rho_req\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}],
                          "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"\"pReq\"", "\[Rule]",
                          RowBox[{"Max", "[", RowBox[{"Abs", "[", RowBox[
                          {"pReq", "-", RowBox[{"columnsOf", "[", RowBox[
                          {"run", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"\"p_req_\"", "<>", RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "#1",
                          "]"}]}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@", "transverse"}]}],
                          "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[
                          {"\"maxRhoReq\"", "\[Rule]", RowBox[{"Max", "[",
                          "rhoReq", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"bg", "[", "\"profile\"", "]"}], "\[Rule]",
                      "dev"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                 {"bg", ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"summaries", "[", "\"exp1\"",
                      "]"}], "[", "\"backgrounds\"", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", "backgroundCheck1"}]], "Input"],
  Cell["Runs. For each of the 26 runs (2 profiles x K in {0, 0.5, 2} x \
initial spinors pos_Bp, pos_Bm, neg_Bp, mix, plus one lambda = 0.5 run per \
profile) the derived RHS du/dt = -i h(M_eff) u, M_eff = m + lambda S0 s(u) \
(U(S) = lambda S^2/2, mean field S = S0 s(u)), is written in the 32-real \
layout directly from hDerived1 (hH = 1). Checked: 9-point finite-difference \
residual of the CSV solution; NDSolve re-integration from the CSV state at t \
= 0 (explicit Runge-Kutta of order 8, PrecisionGoal 13, machine precision); \
the exact propagator exp(-i h t) u0 (h constant because s(u) is conserved) \
against both; the observables rho, p_j, S, KE_L, PE_L, KE_H, PE_H, w, w_L and \
the two norms recomputed from the CSV state with the contract formulas; the \
initial joint eigenvector property; bit-identity of the A = 1 and A = 2 \
spinors.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"exp1H", "=", RowBox[{"hDerived1", "/.",
          "\[VeryThinSpace]", RowBox[{"hH", "\[Rule]", "1"}]}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"exp1GenM", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"realBlock", "[",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", RowBox[{
                SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{"mM"}]], "exp1H"}]}],
            "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"exp1GenK", "=",
        RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"realBlock", "[",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}], " ", RowBox[{
                SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{"kK"}]], "exp1H"}]}],
            "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"exp1LinearInMK", "=",
        RowBox[{RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", RowBox[{"exp1H", "-",
              RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"mM", " ", RowBox[{SubscriptBox[
                       "\[PartialD]", RowBox[{"mM"}]], "exp1H"}]}], "+",
                  RowBox[{"kK", " ", RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]",
                       RowBox[{"kK"}]], "exp1H"}]}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}], "===",
          "zero16"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"exp1Mass", "=",
        RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"exp1Parameters", "[", "\"m\"", "]"}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"rhs1", "[",
          RowBox[{"spec_", ",", "massSign_"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"With", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"lam", "=",
                  RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[", "\"lambda\"", "]"}],
                    "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"dens", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[",
                    RowBox[{"spec", "[", "\"density\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"kk", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[",
                      "\"hiddenMomentumK\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{"Function", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"tt", ",",
                    "y"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{RowBox[{"(", RowBox[{RowBox[{"massSign", " ",
                          "exp1Mass"}], "+", RowBox[{"lam", " ", "dens", " ",
                          RowBox[{"y", ".", "realScalar", ".", "y"}]}]}],
                          ")"}], " ", "exp1GenM"}], "+", RowBox[{"kk", " ",
                        "exp1GenK"}]}], ")"}], ".", "y"}]}], "]"}]}],
          "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{RowBox[{"observables1", "[",
          RowBox[{"spec_", ",", "u_"}], "]"}], ":=",
        RowBox[{"Module", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"lam", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[",
                    RowBox[{"spec", "[", "\"lambda\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"dens", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[",
                      "\"density\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"kk", "=",
                  RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[",
                      "\"hiddenMomentumK\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", "s", ",",
                "meff", ",", "h", ",", "eps", ",", "p0", ",", "lag", ",",
                "rho", ",", "pvec", ",", "keL"}], "}"}], ",",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{"s", "=", RowBox[{"dens", " ", RowBox[
                   {"scalarDensityN", "[", "u", "]"}]}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"meff", "=", RowBox[{"exp1Mass", "+", RowBox[
                   {"lam", " ", "s"}]}]}], ";", RowBox[{"h", "=",
                RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"modeHamiltonian", "[", RowBox[
                     {"meff", ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"kk", ",", "0", ",",
                          "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",", "0", ",",
                          "0"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"eps", "=", RowBox[{"expectN", "[", RowBox[{"u", ",",
                    "h"}], "]"}]}], ";", RowBox[{"p0", "=", RowBox[
                 {RowBox[{"-", "kk"}], " ", RowBox[{"expectN", "[",
                    RowBox[{"u", ",", RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {"gam", "[", "4", "]"}], ".", RowBox[{"gam", "[",
                          "0", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"lag", "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"lam", " ",
                   SuperscriptBox["s", "2"]}], "2"]}], ";", RowBox[{"rho",
                "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"dens", " ", "eps"}], "-", "lag"}]}],
              ";", RowBox[{"pvec", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Join", "[",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"dens", " ", "p0"}], "}"}],
                      ",", RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", RowBox[{"0.`", ",",
                          "6"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "+", "lag"}]}], ";",
              RowBox[{"keL", "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"dens", " ", "eps"}],
