  Cell["Runs x0 in {0, -0.4, 0.5} (x0 = lambda S0/(2m); S0 and lambda from \
summary.json, fixed there by the initial constraint). State (38 reals): ln b, \
ln a, ln c, H_b, H_a, H_c, u. Checked: finite-difference residual (gravity \
and spinor columns separately; late-time spinor rows are under-resolved by \
the output grid, which is uniform in ln V, and are excluded and counted); \
NDSolve re-integration forward and backward from the CSV state at t = 0 \
(order-8 Runge-Kutta, machine precision); a WorkingPrecision 24 backward run \
as the reference for NDSolve's own error; both integrations against the \
closed form. Near the backward end (V/V0 = e^-7, t - t_s ~ 1e-3) the problem \
is ill-conditioned: an error in t of delta shows up as a relative error of \
about delta/(t - t_s); the Rust self-check therefore divides by the \
amplification 1 + |t_s|/(t - t_s), and the same normalised measure is \
reported here next to the raw one. The spinor deviation is split into the raw \
distance and the phase-aligned distance, because the Rust spinor phase at t ~ \
1e4 carries the documented CVODE time-accumulation rounding (summary.json \
maxSpinorPhaseError). Both spinors are also compared with the exact solution \
u(t) = exp(-i (m t + lambda S0 s0 J(t))) u(0), J(t) = Integral_0^t dt/V \
(partial fractions of 1/V in 40-digit arithmetic); the Rust distance must \
reproduce the maxExactSpinorError recorded in summary.json.", "Text"],
  Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{RowBox[{"exp2GenM", "=",
        RowBox[{"realBlock", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"-", "\[ImaginaryI]"}],
            " ", RowBox[{SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", RowBox[{"mM"}]],
              "hDerived2"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{RowBox[{"rhs2", "[", RowBox[{"spec_", ",", "prec_"}], "]"}],
        ":=", RowBox[{"With", "[", RowBox[
           {RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{RowBox[{"s0d", "=", RowBox[{"If", "[",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"prec", "===", "MachinePrecision"}], ",",
                      RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[", "\"S0\"", "]"}],
                        "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"SetPrecision", "[", RowBox[
                         {RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[", "\"S0\"",
                          "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\[Infinity]"}], "]"}]}],
                    "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"lam", "=", RowBox[{"If", "[",
                    RowBox[{RowBox[{"prec", "===", "MachinePrecision"}], ",",
                      RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[", "\"lambda\"",
                          "]"}], "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"SetPrecision", "[",
                        RowBox[{RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"spec", "[",
                          "\"lambda\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\[Infinity]"}],
                        "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", RowBox[{"gen", "=",
                  RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"prec", "===",
                        "MachinePrecision"}], ",", RowBox[{"N", "[",
                        "exp2GenM", "]"}], ",", "exp2GenM"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                RowBox[{"quad", "=", RowBox[{"If", "[", RowBox[
                     {RowBox[{"prec", "===", "MachinePrecision"}], ",",
                      "realScalar", ",", RowBox[{"realBlock", "[", RowBox[
                         {"kreinB", ".", "chargeC"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}],
              "}"}], ",", RowBox[{"Function", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[
                 {"{", RowBox[{"tt", ",", "y"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[
                 {"Module", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"vol", ",",
                        "s", ",", "bigS", ",", "meff", ",", "rho", ",", "p",
                        ",", "th"}], "}"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[{"vol", "=",
                        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"y",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "+", RowBox[{"3", " ",
                          RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "+", RowBox[{"3", " ",
                          RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "3",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
                      RowBox[{"s", "=", RowBox[{RowBox[{"y",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"7", ";;", "38"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ".", "quad", ".",
                          RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"7",
                          ";;", "38"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}], ";",
                      RowBox[{"bigS", "=", FractionBox[RowBox[{"s0d", " ",
                          "s"}], "vol"]}], ";", RowBox[{"meff", "=",
                        RowBox[{"1", "+", RowBox[{"lam", " ", "bigS"}]}]}],
                      ";", RowBox[{"rho", "=", RowBox[{"bigS", "+",
                          FractionBox[RowBox[{"lam", " ", SuperscriptBox[
                          "bigS", "2"]}], "2"]}]}], ";", RowBox[{"p", "=",
                        FractionBox[RowBox[{"lam", " ", SuperscriptBox[
                          "bigS", "2"]}], "2"]}], ";", RowBox[{"th", "=",
                        RowBox[{RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "4",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "+", RowBox[{"3", " ",
                          RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "5",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "+", RowBox[{"3", " ",
                          RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "6",
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}]}], ";", RowBox[
                       {"Join", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"y",
                          "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"4", ";;", "6"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", RowBox[{RowBox[
                          {RowBox[{"-", RowBox[{"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]",
                          RowBox[{"4", ";;", "6"}],
                          "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], " ", "th"}], "+",
                          FractionBox[RowBox[{"rho", "-", "p"}], "6"]}], ",",
                          RowBox[{"meff", " ", RowBox[{"gen", ".", RowBox[
                          {"y", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", RowBox[{"7", ";;",
                          "38"}], "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}]}],
                  "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"exp2Names", "=", RowBox[{"Join", "[",
          RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"\"ln_b\"", ",", "\"ln_a\"", ",",
                "\"ln_c\"", ",", "\"H_b\"", ",", "\"H_a\"", ",", "\"H_c\""}],
              "}"}], ",", "spinorNames"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"hubble0", "=", RowBox[{"N", "[", RowBox[{"Lookup", "[",
            RowBox[{RowBox[{RowBox[{"summaries", "[", "\"exp2\"", "]"}], "[",
                "\"parameters\"", "]"}], ",", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[
                 {"\"hubbleB0\"", ",", "\"hubbleA0\"", ",", "\"hubbleC0\""}],
                "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";",
      RowBox[{"exp2RunResults", "=", RowBox[{"Association", "[",
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", RowBox[{RowBox[{"Module", "[",
                RowBox[{RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"run", ",", "ts", ",", "ys",
                      ",", "i0", ",", "fd", ",", "back", ",", "fwd", ",",
